(7, 12, '8473472883', 'Long Grove', 17, NULL, 'I truly love being around children and creating a fun, safe, and positive environment for them. One of my favorite things in the world is seeing kids genuinely laughing and having fun—it’s so special to be part of that. I enjoy helping children learn and grow, whether it’s reading, simple math, creative play, or just exploring new things together.\n\nI love cooking, arts and crafts, and finding fun ways to keep kids engaged. I feel like I naturally connect with children because I have a warm, patient energy and a bit of a playful, childlike spirit, which helps me build trust and strong connections with them.', '2026-04-03 18:20:57', '2026-04-03 18:20:57', '4639 Twin Lakes Ln 4639 Twin Lakes Ln, Long Grove, United States', 'United States', 'Female', '1998-10-15', 'syttr-profiles/ot1mz7h0rizjq77bqvcuiwx7.jpg', NULL),
