(18, 37, '2242219495', 'Northfield', 8, NULL, 'My name is Blair, I’m 22 and live in Northfield. I have a long history of working with kids and babysitting! I previously worked at Imagine Day Camp in Northfield and Kid Motion in Glencoe, along with many babysitting jobs on the side. I’m also very involved in my nephew’s life, with another niece on the way. I’m currently in esthetician school, but my schedule is very flexible, which gives me availability after 3:30 on weekdays and open availability on weekends.\nI’m looking to pick up some babysitting opportunities! I have experience with children ranging from newborns to age 10 and am comfortable with all ages. I’d love to help with date nights, weekend plans, or occasional evening care.\nI have my own car, reliable transportation, and truly enjoy being around kids. Feel free to message me if you’re looking for a dependable sitter or would like more information!', '2026-05-11 18:39:19', '2026-05-11 18:39:19', '10024 Skokie Blvd 10024 Skokie Blvd, Skokie, United States', 'United States', 'Female', '2003-10-22', NULL, NULL);
